      "gender": "Female",
      "race": "Human",
      "subrace": null,
      "description": "Beauty's sister, envious of the kindness and good fortune the youngest inspires in everyone.",
      "personality": "Proud and self-absorbed, quick to resent Beauty's good fortune.",
      "motivation": "Hopes Beauty's return to the castle will end badly for her, out of sheer jealousy.",
      "qualities": "Sharp-witted enough to talk Beauty into staying past her promised week.",
      "weaknesses": "Her envy blinds her to how her scheming nearly costs the Beast his life.",
      "biography": "One of Beauty's two older sisters, who never forgave the family's fall from wealth and resents that Beauty seems happier for it.",
      "plannedTimeline": "Left humbled once the curse breaks and Beauty's fortune is restored, her fate softened only by Beauty's mercy.",
